% The home as a metis domain. Formalized from the devices found on the flat's
% network on 2026-11-21: one Tuya light, the LG TV, two Prana ventilation
% units. Home Assistant is only the way through to the devices: no rule of
% the home lives there.
%
% Who writes what. The person's words are typed by the domain agent into one
% intent; the mapper turns the intent into ONE command token (cmd_*). The
% rules consume the command under what the home believes and leave an outcome
% token: done(ACT) or refused(ACT). A rule that switches a device changes the
% belief at once (on(D) | off(D)) and the host actuates the device when the
% rule fires. Every beat the host reads the devices back and corrects the
% belief where the world differs: a device that did not obey, or that somebody
% switched by hand, is a correction the program did not predict (a surprise).
% The host keeps two complementary pairs per device: on(D) | off(D) and
% reachable(D) | unreachable(D).
catalog home 1.
provenance text "the flat's devices: a light, a TV and two ventilation units; each switched on or off on request, or by the night and away scenes; a command is done or refused with a reason" "2026-11-21".
layers (dyn).
stages (serve).

type device {light tv vent_bedroom vent_lab nothing}.
type act {on off night away query time date chat unknown}.

namespace home produce (dyn).

% what the home believes about a device
pred on(device) : home.
pred off(device) : home.
pred reachable(device) : home.
pred unreachable(device) : home.

% the commands, one token per typed intent
pred cmd_on(device) : home.
pred cmd_off(device) : home.
pred cmd_night : home.
pred cmd_away : home.
pred cmd_query(device) : home.
pred cmd_time : home.
pred cmd_date : home.
pred cmd_chat : home.
pred cmd_unknown : home.

% a scene's wish for one device, settled in the same beat
pred want_off(device) : home.
pred switched(device) : home.
pred kept(device) : home.
pred missed(device) : home.

% the outcomes, by act
pred done(act) : home.
pred refused(act) : home.

stage serve {
  % ── one device on or off ──
  %% I turn {D} on.
  on [dyn] : cmd_on(D) * off(D) * $reachable(D) -o on(D) * done(on).
  %% {D} is already on.
  on_already [dyn] : cmd_on(D) * $on(D) -o refused(on).
  %% I can't turn {D} on: it does not answer on the network.
  on_unreachable [dyn] : cmd_on(D) * $off(D) * $unreachable(D) -o refused(on).
  %% I can't turn that on: it is not a device I know in this home.
  on_nothing [dyn] : cmd_on(nothing) -o refused(on).
  %% I turn {D} off.
  off [dyn] : cmd_off(D) * on(D) * $reachable(D) -o off(D) * done(off).
  %% {D} is already off.
  off_already [dyn] : cmd_off(D) * $off(D) -o refused(off).
  %% I can't turn {D} off: it does not answer on the network.
  off_unreachable [dyn] : cmd_off(D) * $on(D) * $unreachable(D) -o refused(off).
  %% I can't turn that off: it is not a device I know in this home.
  off_nothing [dyn] : cmd_off(nothing) -o refused(off).

  % ── the scenes: a wish per device, each settled below ──
  %% Good night: I turn the light, the TV and the lab ventilation off; the bedroom ventilation stays as it is.
  night [dyn] : cmd_night -o want_off(light) * want_off(tv) * want_off(vent_lab) * done(night).
  %% You are leaving: I turn everything off.
  away [dyn] : cmd_away -o want_off(light) * want_off(tv) * want_off(vent_lab) * want_off(vent_bedroom) * done(away).
  %% I turn {D} off for the scene.
  scene_off [dyn] : want_off(D) * on(D) * $reachable(D) -o off(D) * switched(D).
  %% {D} was already off.
  scene_kept [dyn] : want_off(D) * $off(D) -o kept(D).
  %% I could not turn {D} off: it does not answer on the network.
  scene_missed [dyn] : want_off(D) * $on(D) * $unreachable(D) -o missed(D).

  % ── questions and talk ──
  %% I tell you that {D} is on.
  query_on [dyn] : cmd_query(D) * $on(D) -o done(query).
  %% I tell you that {D} is off.
  query_off [dyn] : cmd_query(D) * $off(D) -o done(query).
  %% I can't say: that is not a device I know in this home.
  query_nothing [dyn] : cmd_query(nothing) -o refused(query).
  %% I tell you the time.
  time [dyn] : cmd_time -o done(time).
  %% I tell you the date.
  date [dyn] : cmd_date -o done(date).
  %% I answer in kind.
  chat [dyn] : cmd_chat -o done(chat).
  %% I can't do that: it is not something this home can do.
  unknown [dyn] : cmd_unknown -o refused(unknown).
}

% the home at the start: everything off and reachable (the host corrects it on the first beat)
#init off(light) 1
#init off(tv) 1
#init off(vent_bedroom) 1
#init off(vent_lab) 1
#init reachable(light) 1
#init reachable(tv) 1
#init reachable(vent_bedroom) 1
#init reachable(vent_lab) 1
#query on(light)
#query done(on)
#query refused(on)
#steps 6
